        <span data-lang="pt"
          >Eles não são rivais — são camadas. BLUF é a
          <strong>manchete</strong> (1–2 frases). STAR é a
          <strong>prova</strong> que segue.</span
        ><span data-lang="en"
          >They're not rivals — they're layers. BLUF is the
          <strong>headline</strong> (1–2 sentences). STAR is the
          <strong>proof</strong> that follows.</span
        >
      </p>

